      "writtenOn": "2024-01-31T13:06:46Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "As I understand, yes, this is correct topology.\n\nMajor use case is for audio balancing in devices with few speakers, i.e. headphones (not buds) or some other audio devices with even more speakers. Second use case which I heard is to balancing sound types i.e. music/voice/notifications.",
      "parentUuid": "376b2126_e0bd1542",
      "revId": "907f99585fc4900b2fbda296b1704d10368c4ace",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
